to-countdown-pill--termine" aria-label="L&#039;evento terminerà tra 62 giorni"><span class="salerno-evento-countdown-pill__bar" style="width:83%;" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="salerno-evento-countdown-pill__text"><i class="fas fa-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> L&#039;evento terminerà tra 62 giorni</span></span></span><span class="salerno-correlati__title">Luci d’Artista &#8211; 2026-2027</span><span class="salerno-spettacoli__pills"><span class="salerno-post-evento-pill salerno-spettacoli-pill"><i class="fas fa-ticket" aria-hidden="true"></i> Gratuito</span><span class="salerno-post-evento-pill salerno-spettacoli-pill"><i class="fas fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> 7 Nov 2026 – 24 Gen 2027</span></span></a></article></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></p>
